			],
			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 7 components\n\nSynchronize Air, Cocoon, Grove, Mist, Mountain, Output, and Rest submodules with the following changes:\n- **Air:** Migrate SHA256 checksum generation to hex::encode for sha2 0.11 compatibility — sha2 crate 0.11 changed `Digest::finalize()` output from `GenericArray` to `hybrid_array::Array`. Replace format!(\"{:x}\", …) with hex::encode() across Daemon/Manager, Indexing/Scan/ScanFile, Indexing/State/CreateState, Security/ChecksumVerifier, Updates/UpdateManager, and Vine/Server/AirVinegRPCService.\n- **Mist:** Update to hickory-server 0.26 API — Migrate from hickory-server 0.25 module reorganization (authority::* → zone_handler::*, InMemoryAuthority → InMemoryZoneHandler<T>, ServerFuture → Server, AXFR bool → AxfrPolicy enum). Add DNS_TCP_RESPONSE_BUFFER_SIZE constant (65,535 bytes) for TCP listener registration.\n- **Mountain:** Update build configuration for development profile — Rename binary, lib, and product to include DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_Mountain. Add Binary/node to externalBin in tauri.conf.json. Replace deprecated posthog-rs api_endpoint() with host(). Apply sha2 0.11 hex::encode migration to ConfigurationBridge.rs.\n- **Rest:** Migrate to OXC 0.127 API for codegen and transform — Replace flat `comments: bool` in CodegenOptions with structured CommentOptions type. Migrate from deprecated `into_symbol_table_and_scope_tree()` / `build_with_symbols_and_scopes()` to unified `into_scoping()` / `build_with_scoping()` returning a single Scoping value.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers dependency compatibility, API migrations, and build configuration alignment while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
